# handle-hover-scale (h7-plane): the pointer resting on the scale square
# (unit point at plot (2,-1) = page (1028,540)). a and b lit, one dashed
# box with both measured sides, cursor grab-hover.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2&h=1&k=-3
wait 500
move 1028 540
wait 300
shot handle-hover-scale
